Binary incorrect feedback rejects only the submitted output; it does not localize errors or validate a nearby alternative. Before another action, rebuild the evidence from all demonstrations, including no-op and visually heterogeneous pairs. Record role colors, exact changed and preserved cells, candidate rule, and whether the rule reproduces every demo. Identify the specific model correction being tested and the evidence for it.

